Historical (2026-06-26): the 2026-06 bugfix commit as a patch, superseded by README.md and
docs/DEVLOG.md as of 2026-10-22. It is already in history; do not re-apply. (To feed it to
`git am`, delete these lines first.)

From f1212589b741eb86cbbc4bbfad41a9afd4bb19a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lichris174 <lichris174@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 14:40:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] bugfix: address UI/app bugs from review

- useChat: avoid empty user bubble on image-only sends; keep partial text on cancel
- main.py: persist error message instead of partial response when streaming fails
- useSettings/types: remove dead theme field (useTheme owns theme)
- RegionSelect: window-level mouseup so releasing outside overlay finishes drag
- HistoryPanel: refresh when visible prop becomes true
- VoicePanel: surface speech recognition errors
- ChatPanel: focus input once on mount instead of autoFocus on every render
- SettingsPanel: type-safe boolean toggle helper
- config.py: remove misleading module-level OLLAMA_HOST binding
- main.py: reuse lifespan OllamaClient when routing picks default model
- agents/loop: parse balanced JSON blocks instead of greedy regex
- tauri.conf.json: disable resizing, add restrictive CSP
- main.rs: propagate shortcut registration errors to frontend
